<!-- His Highness-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>[ITALICS]Asalaamu alaikoum[\ITALICS], [CT_NAME]. I represent the most holy [OUR_CIV_ADJ]; it is my duty to offer you the opportunity to convert to the one true faith.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>You will excuse me if I cannot spare a moment. It is time for the noonday prayer.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>I shall quote from the Holy Qur'an, Sura 8:15: O ye who believe! When ye meet the Unbelievers preparing for battle, do not turn your backs to them, else you incur the wrath of God, and Hell shall be your home, an evil dwelling indeed!</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>[ITALICS]Assalaam-u alaikoum[\ITALICS], friend [CT_NAME]! Servants, fetch forth my finest and most non-alcoholic wines!</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>Unbeliever! Commoner! You are fortunate that I waste my breath speaking with you. Well then, let's hear it.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>The most sacred Pillar of Islam is the duty to help those in need. Will you grant us your aid?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>Historically, nonbelievers under the Ottoman Sultanate were asked to pay an extra tax in compensation for shirking their duty to give alms under Islamic law. A quaint and appealing custom, don't you think?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_HIGHNESS_1</Tag>
		<English>Wretched unbeliever! I demand that you convert at once, or pay us this tithe in compensation.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
