<!-- Director Green-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>Greetings, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME], acting head of [OUR_CIV_ADJ] offworld operations. I'm sure we will have a long and profitable relationship, as long as the free flow of capital is respected.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>I'm in a meeting. Go away.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>Peace hardly seems profitable at this juncture. For us, I mean.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>Welcome, welcome! The Board is very excited about our next joint venture. I can practically feel the synergy.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>Time is money, [CT_NAME]. Spit it out.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>And so, as you can see from this PowerPoint hologram, a down market can be the perfect time to invest. Shall I have my bankers draw up a prospectus?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>You know, I had my personal assistant FedEx you that fruit basket last Christmas. This would be the least you could do.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_GREEN_1</Tag>
		<English>I need to make my earnings target for this quarter. That means you need to pay up.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
<!-- Nightinggale-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_NIGHTINGGALE_1</Tag>
		<English>[CT_NAME], you say? Interesting. I am Nightinggale of the Cyeans. I would be delighted to learn the history of your people.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_NIGHTINGGALE_1</Tag>
		<English>There is nothing you could say that I would wish to pass on to my children; there is nothing you could say that would not bring me shame if I shared it with my people. Be silent!</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_NIGHTINGGALE_1</Tag>
		<English>Your actions have made this war inevitable, [CT_NAME]. It will end through the actions of the Cyeans, and the story of your annihilation will be preserved in our records for all eternity.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_NIGHTINGGALE_1</Tag>
		<English>Your people have the concept of libraries, yes? I would dearly love the opportunity to visit one, [CT_NAME]; perhaps one day you could arrange a private visit for me.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_NIGHTINGGALE_1</Tag>
		<English>Conveying to you exactly how much I detest your presence and that of your kind would almost be worth making physical contact with you. Almost. Be grateful that the sensation of disgust you bring me is something I cannot directly share.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
