<!-- Progenitor Exarch-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_CRUSADE_PROGENITOR_TARGET_PLAYER_TRANSCENDS</Tag>
		<English>Curiosity killed the cat... DO YOU NOT KNOW DEATH WHEN YOU SEE IT, [CT_NAME]? [BOLD][COLOR_WARNING_TEXT]THERE IS NO LIFE... IN THE VOID... ONLY... DEATH.[COLOR_REVERT][\BOLD]</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_OBLIGE_PROGENITOR_WHEN_PLAYER_TRANSCENDS</Tag>
		<English>Heed my words, [CT_NAME]. Soon an influence of chaos, the likes of which you cannot imagine, shall fall down upon your people. It will be a storm of death. We must unite and stop the people of [CIV_TRANSCENDENCE] from tearing reality apart and unleashing the indescribable upon this universe! [BOLD][COLOR_WARNING_TEXT]THE COLONY OF [CITY_NAME_TRANSCENDENCE] IS CONDEMNED![COLOR_REVERT][\BOLD]</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
<!-- The Ascetic Cenobite-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_CENOBITE_1</Tag>
		<English>I greet you in the name of the people of Navbharat, [CT_NAME]. I hope that we may walk the Noble Eightfold Path together in peace and harmony.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_CENOBITE_1</Tag>
		<English>You are trying my patience, [CT_NAME]. Begone!</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_CENOBITE_1</Tag>
		<English>Peace? YOU speak of peace? No, [CT_NAME], I regret that there can be no peace while your actions speak of nothing but war.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_CENOBITE_1</Tag>
		<English>With friends like you, [CT_NAME], the cycle of Samsara is not so unpleasant. How can Navbharat assist you?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_CENOBITE_1</Tag>
		<English>Oh, it's you. I know not what I did in a previous life to merit the punishment of having to speak to you, but it must have been truly despicable. What do you want?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_LEADER_CENOBITE_1</Tag>
		<English>TBD</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
