		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_LEADER_CENOBITE_1</Tag>
		<English>TBD</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
<!-- The Model Citizen-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>[ITALICS]Ohayo gozaimas[\ITALICS], [CT_NAME]. They call me [OUR_NAME] - and not just because of these good looks. I can assure you I am, in general, quite well-behaved. Can you say the same?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>[ITALICS]Tachisarinasai[\ITALICS]! Barbarian, I have nothing to say.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>Peace? Never! The Son of Heaven has decreed your eternal doom!</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>Ah, my honourable friend. Please join me for the traditional Shinto Tea Ceremony - now fully automated for maximum efficiency.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>Ssss, [ITALICS]wakawakashii kusata gaijin[\ITALICS]! You infantile, malodorous barbarian! Oops, did I just say that in English?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>It is to my humble shame that I come before you as a beggar. Will you help us?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>It is traditional in my society to give gifts to mark the passing of the New Year. Usually paper cranes, but this is more what I had in mind.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_MODEL_1</Tag>
		<English>Give us what we ask, or there's an interplanetary Pearl Harbor in store for you.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
<!-- Minister of Liberty-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_MINISTER_1</Tag>
		<English>Kosmiczna Polska is glad to make your acquaintance, [CT_NAME]. Are you a fellow advocate of liberty?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_MINISTER_1</Tag>
		<English>My people have suffered enough! We don't need to listen to your oppressive ramblings!</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_MINISTER_1</Tag>
		<English>Peace? Poland is no stranger to oppressors, [CT_NAME]. We have already learned the all-too-bitter lesson that the likes of you cannot be negotiated with.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_MINISTER_1</Tag>
		<English>The winds of freedom are sweeping the galaxy, [CT_NAME]. Nowa Polska is fortunate to have a friend like you to enjoy the breeze with.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_MINISTER_1</Tag>
		<English>I swear to God, if you are calling to whine about how weird you think pasta and strawberries are or to make more 'Poland can into space' jokes, there will be [BOLD]WAR[/BOLD] between our people! Choose your next words very carefully.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_LEADER_MINISTER_1</Tag>
		<English>TBD</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_LEADER_MINISTER_1</Tag>
		<English>TBD</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
