<!-- The Lady in Black-->
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_MIRANDA_1</Tag>
		<English>Hah! [CT_NAME], is it? They call me [OUR_NAME] - and the last person who asked me why is now missing several very important organs. So tell me, sweet cheeks, what can I do for you today?</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_MIRANDA_1</Tag>
		<English>GO AWAY. Fuckin' narc.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
	</TEXT>
	<TEXT>
		<Tag>AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_MIRANDA_1</Tag>
		<English>Oh, so we're supposed to make up and be best friends? How perfectly charming. Prepare for the real world, asshole.</English>
		<French></French>
		<German></German>
		<Italian></Italian>
		<Spanish></Spanish>
